#: flowview_filters.php
msgid "Materialization pre-computes the results of a Filter for each flow partition, with NAT on and off, and stores them in the Parallel Query cache, so reports over older data open quickly.  New partitions are materialized automatically once they stop receiving flows.  Required means partitions that have rotated are not materialized yet, Running means a materialization is in progress, and Up to date means every rotated partition is materialized.  Running: N is how many queries of the Filter are working now.  The partition still receiving flows is not materialized, so it does not count."
msgstr "Uhalisishaji hukokotoa awali matokeo ya Kichujio kwa kila sehemu ya mtiririko, NAT ikiwa imewashwa na ikiwa imezimwa, na huyahifadhi katika hifadhi muda ya Parallel Query, ili ripoti za data ya zamani zifunguke haraka.  Sehemu mpya huhalisishwa kiotomatiki mara tu zinapoacha kupokea mitiririko.  Inahitajika inamaanisha sehemu zilizozungushwa bado hazijahalisishwa, Inafanya kazi inamaanisha uhalisishaji unaendelea, na Imesasishwa inamaanisha kila sehemu iliyozungushwa imehalisishwa.  Inafanya kazi: N ni idadi ya hoja za Kichujio zinazofanya kazi sasa.  Sehemu ambayo bado inapokea mitiririko haihalisishwi, kwa hivyo haihesabiwi."

