#: setup.php
msgid "Many Big Tech data collection services like to mask their ownership of domains to obfuscate the fact that they are collecting your personal information.  If you are concerned with this and your Cacti install has access to the Internet, you can use Arin to remove the mask from those Big Tech companies."
msgstr "Huduma nyingi za ukusanyaji wa data za Big Tech hupenda kuficha umiliki wao wa vikoa ili kuficha ukweli kwamba zinakusanya taarifa zako za kibinafsi. Ikiwa una wasiwasi kuhusu hili na usakinishaji wako wa Cacti una ufikiaji wa Mtandao, unaweza kutumia Arin kuondoa kificho hicho kutoka kwa kampuni hizo za Big Tech."

