#: setup.php
msgid "Parallel Queries"
msgstr "Hoji Sambamba"

#: setup.php
msgid "Parallel Query Backend"
msgstr "Mfumo wa Nyuma wa Hoji Sambamba"

#: setup.php
msgid "Choose how parallel FlowView queries are executed.  The Legacy PHP Runner forks the flowview_runner.php process per query and shard.  The FlowView Query Service dispatches the same map-reduce work to a long-running Go service over localhost, avoiding per-query process startup and database polling latency.  Requires the flowview-query service (see plugins/flowview/service/flowview-query) to be installed and running."
msgstr "Chagua jinsi hoja sambamba za FlowView zinavyotekelezwa.  Legacy PHP Runner hugawa mchakato wa flowview_runner.php kwa kila hoja na kipande.  FlowView Query Service hutuma kazi iyo hiyo ya map-reduce kwa huduma ya Go inayoendeshwa kwa muda mrefu kupitia localhost, ikiepuka ucheleweshaji wa kuanzisha mchakato kwa kila hoja na ukusanyaji wa hifadhidata.  Inahitaji huduma ya flowview-query (angalia plugins/flowview/service/flowview-query) iwe imesakinishwa na inaendeshwa."

#: setup.php
msgid "Legacy PHP Runner"
msgstr "Kiendeshaji cha Zamani cha PHP"

#: setup.php
msgid "FlowView Query Service"
msgstr "Huduma ya Hoji ya FlowView"

#: setup.php
msgid "Query Service URL"
msgstr "URL ya Huduma ya Hoja"

#: setup.php
msgid "Base URL of the FlowView Query Service, for example http://127.0.0.1:8699.  Leave blank to auto-discover the ephemeral port from the service's port file."
msgstr "URL ya Msingi ya Huduma ya Hoji ya FlowView, kwa mfano http://127.0.0.1:8699.  Acha wazi ili kugundua kiotomatiki lango la muda kutoka kwa faili ya lango la huduma."

#: setup.php
msgid "Query Service Port File"
msgstr "Faili ya Mlango wa Huduma ya Hoja"

#: setup.php
msgid "Path to the port file the FlowView Query Service writes its bound address to.  Used to discover the service endpoint when the Query Service URL above is blank."
msgstr "Njia ya faili ya mlango ambapo Huduma ya Hoji ya FlowView huandika anwani yake iliyofungwa.  Hutumika kugundua mwisho wa huduma wakati URL ya Huduma ya Hoji iliyo hapo juu iko wazi."

#: setup.php
msgid "Query Service Token"
msgstr "Tokeni ya Huduma ya Hoja"

#: setup.php
msgid "Optional shared secret.  When set, Cacti sends it to the FlowView Query Service as an \"Authorization: Bearer\" header and the service rejects any state-changing request that does not present the same token.  Set the matching value in the service's config file (auth_token) or the FLOWVIEW_QUERY_TOKEN environment variable.  Recommended whenever the service is reachable by anything other than trusted local processes."
msgstr "Siri ya pamoja ya hiari. Inapowekwa, Cacti huituma kwa Huduma ya Hoji ya FlowView kama kichwa cha \"Authorization: Bearer\" na huduma hukataa ombi lolote la kubadilisha hali lisilowasilisha tokeni hiyo hiyo. Weka thamani inayolingana katika faili ya usanidi ya huduma (auth_token) au kigezo cha mazingira cha FLOWVIEW_QUERY_TOKEN. Inapendekezwa wakati wowote huduma inapoweza kufikiwa na kitu kingine chochote isipokuwa michakato ya ndani inayoaminika."

#: setup.php
msgid "Max Concurrent Threads"
msgstr "Idadi ya Juu ya Nyuzi za Wakati Mmoja"

#: setup.php
msgid "The maximum number of threads that will be dispatched to run the FlowView queries.  Note that you can have at most 1 thread per database partition, and you should be careful not to overload your database server with having too many concurrent threads running."
msgstr "Idadi ya juu ya nyuzi zitakazotumwa kuendesha hoja za FlowView.  Kumbuka kuwa unaweza kuwa na uzi 1 kwa kila sehemu ya hifadhidata kwa kiwango cha juu, na unapaswa kuwa mwangalifu usilemee seva yako ya hifadhidata kwa kuwa na nyuzi nyingi zinazoendeshwa kwa wakati mmoja."

#: setup.php
